# casefeature-truncation — regression fixture for uniqueCapSlug (truncation-collision safety).
library "Case Feature Truncation".

// Two DISTINCT `code is` concepts whose names share a long prefix and differ only
// past the FHIR id 64-char boundary. With policyId base `casefeature-truncation-fixture`
// (30 chars), each composite `<policyId>-<concept>` is ~91 chars — pre-fix both bare-
// truncated to the SAME 64-char id/url (a closure collision that hard-failed emit).
// `uniqueCapSlug` now appends a deterministic `-<sha256[0:12]>` so the two derive
// distinct ids/urls, and — because the decision condition is an inferred `sem-or`
// over both leaves — each leaf becomes a recursive `action.input` whose profile must
// byte-equal its emitted case-feature StructureDefinition url.

concept "History Of Recurrent Skin Maceration With Bacterial Infection":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `skin-maceration-bacterial`.
- definition is exists this.

concept "History Of Recurrent Skin Maceration With Fungal Infection":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `skin-maceration-fungal`.
- definition is exists this.

concept "Recurrent Skin Maceration Infection":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as ( "History Of Recurrent Skin Maceration With Bacterial Infection" sem-or "History Of Recurrent Skin Maceration With Fungal Infection" ).

activity "Refer to Wound Care":
- request CPGServiceRequest.

decision "Triage Maceration":
- when "Recurrent Skin Maceration Infection" then recommend activity "Refer to Wound Care".
